{"seq":3,"slug":"tax-id-lifecycle-multi-jurisdiction","title":"税号生命周期与多辖区并存治理：注册、变更与注销","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-indirect-tax-determination-remittance/indirect-tax-regime-registration-model/tax-id-lifecycle-multi-jurisdiction","wordCount":2898,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"税号生命周期与多辖区并存治理-注册-变更与注销\">税号生命周期与多辖区并存治理：注册、变更与注销</h1><p>一个跨境卖家在欧盟注册了 OSS，在英国有 GB 增值税号，在美国十余个州有销售税许可，在加拿大有简化 GST/HST 号——这些税号不是静态字符串，而是各自带状态、生效日、申报周期、终止义务的<strong>有状态对象</strong>。真正拖垮财税系统的从来不是&quot;怎么算税&quot;，而是&quot;某个税号在哪一天生效、哪一天失效、失效后还有哪些尾随申报没做&quot;。一个过期的州许可继续在结账页上被当作有效凭证，会让平台在被稽查时同时承担漏征与错误豁免两类责任。</p>\n<p>本文把税号从&quot;注册那一刻&quot;扩展到整个生命周期：注册触发与生效时点、登记信息变更、注销与最终申报，以及支撑这些操作的数据模型。后续判定引擎与结账代收都从这张台账读取&quot;此刻哪个税号有效&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-税号是一个跨辖区的有状态对象\">核心概念：税号是一个跨辖区的有状态对象</h2><p>跨境间接税的复杂性根源在于<strong>同一笔交易在不同辖区被赋予不同的纳税人</strong>。欧盟的 OSS/IOSS 是一次注册覆盖多国的收付机制：企业在**识别成员国（Member State of Identification）**注册一次，就能通过该国门户为全部成员国的 B2C 供货统一申报（欧洲委员会 VAT One Stop Shop 门户）。美国的销售税则相反，没有联邦层面的一般销售税，45 个州加华盛顿特区、波多黎各与关岛各自征税，Alaska、Delaware、Montana、New Hampshire、Oregon 五地不设州级销售税（Wikipedia, <em>Sales taxes in the United States</em>）。&quot;一次注册、多国申报&quot;与&quot;逐州注册、逐州申报&quot;是两种极端的生命周期拓扑，任何台账模型都必须同时容纳。制度层为何产生这种差异，见同章 <a href=\"ioss-oss-vat-regime-matrix\">IOSS/OSS/VoEC 与英美销售税制度矩阵</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[未注册&lt;br/&gt;not_registered] --&gt;|阈值触发或自愿| B[申请中&lt;br/&gt;pending]&#10;  B --&gt;|税务机关批准| C[有效&lt;br/&gt;active]&#10;  B --&gt;|驳回/撤回| A&#10;  C --&gt;|地址/名称/银行变更| C&#10;  C --&gt;|停止应税活动| D[注销申请&lt;br/&gt;closing]&#10;  D --&gt;|最终申报完成| E[已终止&lt;br/&gt;terminated]&#10;  C --&gt;|被税务机关排除| E&#10;  E --&gt;|尾随申报义务暴露| F[历史补报&lt;br/&gt;late_filing]\">graph TD\n  A[未注册&lt;br/&gt;not_registered] --&gt;|阈值触发或自愿| B[申请中&lt;br/&gt;pending]\n  B --&gt;|税务机关批准| C[有效&lt;br/&gt;active]\n  B --&gt;|驳回/撤回| A\n  C --&gt;|地址/名称/银行变更| C\n  C --&gt;|停止应税活动| D[注销申请&lt;br/&gt;closing]\n  D --&gt;|最终申报完成| E[已终止&lt;br/&gt;terminated]\n  C --&gt;|被税务机关排除| E\n  E --&gt;|尾随申报义务暴露| F[历史补报&lt;br/&gt;late_filing]</pre><p>四段状态里，<strong>&quot;已终止&quot;并不等于&quot;无义务&quot;</strong>：注销后仍可能因终止前期间被追征税款，或在别的辖区因存量库存触发库存地注册义务。数据模型必须把&quot;税号状态&quot;与&quot;申报义务状态&quot;拆开，否则无法表达 E→F 这条回路。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>辖区类型</th>\n<th>注册粒度</th>\n<th>申报频率</th>\n<th>终止触发器</th>\n<th>典型代表</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>欧盟统一申报</td>\n<td>一次注册覆盖多国</td>\n<td>OSS 季度 / IOSS 月度</td>\n<td>自愿注销或被排除</td>\n<td>OSS、IOSS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>美国州级</td>\n<td>每州独立许可</td>\n<td>多为月度，小卖家可季度/年度</td>\n<td>停止在该州销售、许可作废</td>\n<td>各州销售税许可</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>英国单一税号</td>\n<td>一国一号</td>\n<td>按 MTD 周期</td>\n<td>不再符合注册资格</td>\n<td>UK VAT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加拿大简制</td>\n<td>非居民专用简制</td>\n<td>按 CRA 规定</td>\n<td>停止向加销售</td>\n<td>简化 GST/HST</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>申报频率决定税号台账的&quot;心跳&quot;</strong>：IOSS 月度意味着失效税号 30 天内暴露，而美国某州的季度申报可能让错误状态潜伏三个月。台账校验频率应至少等于其最高频次的申报周期。</p>\n<h2 id=\"注册触发-滚动阈值与生效时点\">注册触发：滚动阈值与生效时点</h2><p>注册义务的触发几乎从不是&quot;瞬时&quot;的，而是<strong>滚动窗口 + 阈值</strong>。美国各州的经济关联（economic nexus）自 2018 年 <em>South Dakota v. Wayfair</em> 判决推翻物理存在要件后全面铺开，绝大多数州采用&quot;过去或当前日历年销售额达到 10 万美元&quot;的口径：California、New York、Texas 用 50 万美元高门槛（New York 还要求超过 100 笔交易），Alabama、Mississippi 用 25 万美元。完整判定逻辑见 <a href=\"registration-obligation-threshold-model\">注册义务判定</a>。</p>\n<p>把辖区 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 的阈值记为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、交易额记为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，滚动 12 个月口径下的触发条件是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>12</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mn>11</mn></munderover><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mtext>nexus</mtext><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>12</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_t^{(12)} = \\sum_{k=0}^{11} R_{t-k}, \\qquad \\text{nexus}_j = \\left[ S_t^{(12)} \\ge \\theta_j \\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2906em;vertical-align:-0.2458em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4542em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">12</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2458em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1032em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8011em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">11</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">nexus</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4542em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">12</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2458em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>阈值口径并非静态。据 Sales Tax Institute 对照表（快照日 2026-08-01），近年持续&quot;去交易笔数化&quot;：Alaska 于 2025-01-01、Utah 于 2025-07-01、Illinois 于 2026-01-01、Kentucky 于 2026-08-01 相继移除 200 笔交易门槛。这意味着<strong>把&quot;交易笔数&quot;写成硬编码规则的系统会随年份失效</strong>，应把阈值参数化为可随时间版本化的配置。</p>\n<p>欧盟侧的触发是<strong>选择权 + 阈值</strong>的组合：跨国 B2C 电信、广播与电子服务（TBE）与欧盟内远程销售货物的合并年额不超过 <strong>10,000 欧元</strong>时按供应商所在国征税、不进 OSS；超过则适用目的地规则。供应商也可主动选择目的地规则，选择后<strong>绑定两个日历年</strong>（欧洲委员会 VAT One Stop Shop 门户）——这是状态机里易漏的自环，让&quot;注册&quot;决策带上不可逆的时间成本。</p>\n<p>生效时点与触发时点是两件事。英国规定超过 90,000 英镑注册门槛后须在<strong>该月末起 30 天内</strong>注册，注册<strong>自跨过门槛后的第二个月第一天</strong>生效（GOV.UK, <em>VAT registration</em>）。系统需建模触发日 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>trigger</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\text{trigger}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">trigger</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、提交日 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>file</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\text{file}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">file</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、生效日 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>effective</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\text{effective}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">effective</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；结账的&quot;是否代收&quot;必须锚定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>effective</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\text{effective}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">effective</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，中间空窗期的交易是回溯补申报的对象，不是&quot;未注册所以不代收&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"变更与并存-一实体多税号的台账治理\">变更与并存：一实体多税号的台账治理</h2><p>跨境卖家最常见的状态不是&quot;一个税号&quot;，而是<strong>几十个并存的税号</strong>，分属不同法律实体、辖区、税率、申报周期。治理的第一个问题是<strong>归属</strong>：税号属于法人实体（legal entity），台账必须以&quot;法人实体 × 辖区 × 制度&quot;为三元键，而非&quot;店铺&quot;——店铺可关闭重开，法人实体不会。</p>\n<p>第二个问题是<strong>并存下的选择</strong>。同一笔交易可能同时被多个已注册税号覆盖（例如既在 OSS 下、又在某成员国本地注册），此时不允许双重代收。选择规则需要显式落库：专门制度（OSS/IOSS）优先于普通本地注册，平台代收（marketplace deemed supplier）优先于卖家自收。加拿大自 2021-07-01 起对非居民供应商与平台运营者引入数字经济的 GST/HST 规则，平台运营者在特定情形下须就平台促成的供货代收（CRA, <em>GST/HST for digital-economy businesses</em>）；欧盟侧 IOSS 覆盖 0–150 欧元进口货物，超过 150 欧元在进口环节征税，酒类烟草等消费税货物不可使用（Wikipedia, <em>Import One-Stop Shop</em>）。</p>\n<p>第三个问题是<strong>登记信息变更的传播</strong>。非欧盟企业使用 IOSS **必须有欧盟境内的中介（intermediary）**担保其义务（Wikipedia, <em>Import One-Stop Shop</em>）；中介更换等同于实质性变更。工程含义是：<strong>税号台账必须是唯一真相源，结账、开票、报关三处都从它派生</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[交易请求] --&gt; B{平台是否 deemed supplier?}&#10;  B --&gt;|是| C[平台代收&lt;br/&gt;使用平台税号]&#10;  B --&gt;|否| D{供货是否落入 OSS/IOSS?}&#10;  D --&gt;|是| E[读取制度税号&lt;br/&gt;OSS 季度 / IOSS 月度]&#10;  D --&gt;|否| F{买家辖区有本地注册?}&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[使用本地税号代收]&#10;  F --&gt;|否| H[不代收&lt;br/&gt;或触发注册评估]&#10;  E --&gt; I[写回台账]&#10;  G --&gt; I&#10;  C --&gt; I\">flowchart TD\n  A[交易请求] --&gt; B{平台是否 deemed supplier?}\n  B --&gt;|是| C[平台代收&lt;br/&gt;使用平台税号]\n  B --&gt;|否| D{供货是否落入 OSS/IOSS?}\n  D --&gt;|是| E[读取制度税号&lt;br/&gt;OSS 季度 / IOSS 月度]\n  D --&gt;|否| F{买家辖区有本地注册?}\n  F --&gt;|是| G[使用本地税号代收]\n  F --&gt;|否| H[不代收&lt;br/&gt;或触发注册评估]\n  E --&gt; I[写回台账]\n  G --&gt; I\n  C --&gt; I</pre><h2 id=\"注销与终止-最终申报与尾随义务\">注销与终止：最终申报与尾随义务</h2><p>注销不是&quot;把状态置为 terminated&quot;就结束。它由一组<strong>必须按序完成</strong>的动作构成，顺序错了会造成不可逆的错误。英国的规定给出了一条清晰的时间线：企业停止符合资格后<strong>必须在 30 天内注销</strong>，否则可能被处罚；注销通常由 HMRC 在约 <strong>40 个工作日</strong>内确认，关联的 EORI 号会随增值税注册自动注销（GOV.UK, <em>Cancel your VAT registration</em>）。英国注销门槛为 <strong>88,000 英镑</strong>，低于注册门槛 90,000——&quot;注册门槛 ≠ 注销门槛&quot;本身就是状态机陷阱：处于两门槛之间的企业既不必注册、又不被强制注销，属于滞回（hysteresis）区间。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>notify</mtext></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>ineligible</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>30</mn><mtext> 天 (UK)</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>register</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">£</mi><mn>90,000</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>dereg</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">£</mi><mn>88,000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{notify}} \\le d_{\\text{ineligible}} + 30\\ \\text{天 (UK)}, \\qquad \\theta_{\\text{register}} = £90{,}000 &gt; \\theta_{\\text{dereg}} = £88{,}000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">notify</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ineligible</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">天</span><span class=\"mord\"> (UK)</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">register</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">£90</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dereg</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">£88</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>注销的核心交付物是<strong>最终申报（final return）</strong>，覆盖从上一个申报期末到注销生效日的尾段期间，常与正常申报周期错位，需单独生成一期。系统必须在发起注销时冻结该期间的交易快照，否则注销日之后补录的退货、折让会落到已关闭的税号上，成为孤儿凭证。</p>\n<p>欧盟侧的退出路径有两种：<strong>自愿注销（deregistration）<strong>或</strong>被税务机关排除（exclusion）</strong>（欧洲委员会 VAT One Stop Shop 门户）。被排除方通常还有禁止重新注册的冷却期，台账须区分这两种终止原因。</p>\n<p>一条最容易漏掉的尾随义务是<strong>库存地的注册</strong>：卖家为履约把货放进某辖区仓库，可能在没有任何销售的情况下就因物理存在触发注册义务；注销某税号时若该辖区仍有未售库存，注销会被驳回或事后被追溯。</p>\n<h2 id=\"状态机落地-税号台账的数据模型\">状态机落地：税号台账的数据模型</h2><p>把上述语义落成数据模型，最小可用字段集如下表。设计意图是让每一次&quot;能不能代收&quot;的判断都变成一次对台账的确定性查询，而不是散落在结账代码里的 <code>if</code>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>关键约束</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>legal_entity_id</code></td>\n<td>主键</td>\n<td>税号归属的法人实体</td>\n<td>与店铺解耦</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>jurisdiction</code></td>\n<td>主键</td>\n<td>辖区代码（EU / US-CA / GB / CA）</td>\n<td>ISO 或内部字典</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>regime</code></td>\n<td>主键</td>\n<td>制度：OSS / IOSS / US-STATE / UK-VAT</td>\n<td>决定申报周期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>tax_id</code></td>\n<td>字符串</td>\n<td>税号本体（UK 的 GB 号、IOSS 的 IM 号）</td>\n<td>格式按辖区校验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>status</code></td>\n<td>枚举</td>\n<td>pending / active / closing / terminated</td>\n<td>见状态机</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>effective_from</code></td>\n<td>日期</td>\n<td>法律生效日</td>\n<td>结账判断用此字段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>effective_to</code></td>\n<td>日期</td>\n<td>终止日</td>\n<td>空表示仍有效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>filing_frequency</code></td>\n<td>枚举</td>\n<td>monthly / quarterly / annual</td>\n<td>决定心跳校验频率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>intermediary_id</code></td>\n<td>可空</td>\n<td>中介（IOSS 必需）</td>\n<td>非欧盟实体必填</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>exclusion_reason</code></td>\n<td>可空</td>\n<td>自愿注销 / 被排除</td>\n<td>影响冷却期</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>台账的核心查询是&quot;给定法人实体 + 辖区 + 制度 + 交易日期，返回唯一有效税号&quot;，必须满足<strong>时间点唯一性</strong>：任何时刻对同一三元键不允许存在两条 <code>active</code> 记录。实现上可用数据库的部分唯一索引约束 <code>(legal_entity_id, jurisdiction, regime) WHERE status = &#39;active&#39;</code>，把一致性交给存储层而非应用层。</p>\n<p>外部校验是第二道防线。欧盟提供 VIES 校验 VAT 号状态，但**&quot;号码有效&quot;与&quot;已出现在 VIES&quot;之间存在传播延迟**——新注册的税号可能暂时查不到，此时不应判无效，而应进&quot;待确认&quot;队列保留人工复核。美国各州许可、Streamlined Sales Tax（SST）统一注册也各有生效延迟；SST 集中注册门户 SSTRS（sstregister.org）覆盖 23 个正式成员州与 1 个准成员州（Tennessee）（Streamlined Sales Tax Governing Board）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>税号是<strong>有状态对象</strong>：未注册 → 申请中 → 有效 → 注销中 → 已终止，且&quot;已终止&quot;不等于&quot;无义务&quot;。</li>\n<li>注册触发是<strong>滚动窗口 + 阈值</strong>，阈值逐年演进（2025–2026 多州移除交易笔数测试），必须版本化配置而非硬编码。</li>\n<li>欧盟 OSS/IOSS 是&quot;一次注册、覆盖多国&quot;，美国是&quot;逐州注册、逐州申报&quot;，两种拓扑须在一个台账里并存。</li>\n<li>&quot;选择适用目的地规则即锁定两个日历年&quot;这类<strong>自环约束</strong>决定了注册决策的不可逆性。</li>\n<li>注销绑定<strong>最终申报</strong>，需冻结尾段期间的交易快照；英国&quot;注销 30 天 + 约 40 个工作日确认 + EORI 联动注销&quot;是完整时间线范例。</li>\n<li>台账以 <code>(legal_entity_id, jurisdiction, regime)</code> 为三元键，用部分唯一索引保证<strong>时间点唯一性</strong>；外部校验（VIES 等）有传播延迟，新税号应进&quot;待确认&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"税号生命周期与多辖区并存治理：注册、变更与注销","id":"税号生命周期与多辖区并存治理-注册-变更与注销"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：税号是一个跨辖区的有状态对象","id":"核心概念-税号是一个跨辖区的有状态对象"},{"level":2,"text":"注册触发：滚动阈值与生效时点","id":"注册触发-滚动阈值与生效时点"},{"level":2,"text":"变更与并存：一实体多税号的台账治理","id":"变更与并存-一实体多税号的台账治理"},{"level":2,"text":"注销与终止：最终申报与尾随义务","id":"注销与终止-最终申报与尾随义务"},{"level":2,"text":"状态机落地：税号台账的数据模型","id":"状态机落地-税号台账的数据模型"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"注册义务判定：低值货物、B2B/B2C 与远程销售阈值建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-indirect-tax-determination-remittance/indirect-tax-regime-registration-model/registration-obligation-threshold-model"},"next":{"title":"经济联结度（nexus）与物理存在的判定建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-indirect-tax-determination-remittance/tax-determination-engine/economic-nexus-connection-modeling"}}